                <p style="font-size: 15px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; margin:0;">Pressure-sensing rollers don't just follow a track — they feel resistance, detect relaxation, and modify intensity in real time. When your muscles begin to release, the mechanism responds. This is the foundation of Panasonic's "Human Intelligence" positioning: a massage that evolves as your body changes during the session.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); padding:2.25rem;">
