                <p style="font-size: 15px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; margin:0;">The combination of Junetsu Ultra Kneading (a micro-circular thumb motion refined by Panasonic) and the SL-Track roller path creates a deep-tissue experience that reaches through layers of tension without brute force. It's the kind of pressure a skilled therapist applies — deliberate, controlled, and anatomically aware.</p>
